     <td><para unique="1261833">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261835">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1261839">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+494208"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261844">Convert four packed single precision floating-point values from xmm2/m128/m32bcst to four packed signed doubleword values in xmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
